3.4 Inertia Mutation with Uncertainty Propagation

The three-step mutation of v5.0 is retained, with the covariance-chain qualification added in v6.0. With $\theta = (m_s, r_s, \text{vec}\, I_s^{\text{cm}}) \in \mathbb{R}^{10}$ and $F(\theta) = \text{vec}\, I'_{\text{CG}}$ written as a composition $F = T \circ S$ where $S$ maps to $I_{\text{remaining}}^{\text{old}}$ and $T$ applies the parallel-axis correction with $m' = m - m_s$,

$J_F = \frac{\partial \text{vec}\, T}{\partial \text{vec}\, I} \cdot \frac{\partial \text{vec}\, S}{\partial \theta} + \frac{\partial \text{vec}\, T}{\partial d} \cdot \frac{\partial d}{\partial \theta} + \frac{\partial \text{vec}\, T}{\partial m_s} \cdot e_{m_s}^\top$,

