$\text{I11} : \square(D = \text{DEPLOY} \Rightarrow A_{\text{kernel}} = \text{AUTHORIZE})$,
$\text{I12} : \square(D = \text{DEPLOY} \Rightarrow i \leq N)$,
$\text{I13} : \square(D = \text{DEPLOY} \Rightarrow U_{\text{coll}}(i) \leq P_{c,\text{aggregate}})$,
$\text{I14} : \square(D = \text{DONE} \Rightarrow i = N + 1)$.

Status of invariants. I1, I2, I5, I6, I9, I12, I14 are implemented in the TLA⁺ module of §6.4. I3, I8, I10, I13 are architectural obligations, not checked TLA⁺ invariants, because the module abstracts $P_{\text{budget}}$, $P_c$, $\text{check}(\cdot)$, and $U_{\text{coll}}$ as nondeterministic variables whose physical semantics lie outside the kernel. This is stated explicitly rather than implied.

