Correctness of thresholds; flight readiness; verification of the evidential or physical layer; state-dependent authorization in the discrete kernel; derivation of $P_{c,\text{aggregate}}$ from first principles; probabilistic model of inertia uncertainty; multi-source credal set non-emptiness in general; polynomial-time worst-case decision without the finite-extremal-copula approximation; quantitative validation of the signed-dependence credal set; proof of the refinement relation.

